{"id": 1520, "title": "Pick up friend", "level": "Beginner", "hsk_tags": ["HSK2"], "slug": "pick-up-friend", "audio_url": "/audio/mandarin/1520_pick-up-friend.mp3", "simplified_paragraphs": ["我的好朋友明天在上海有一个工作面试，所以她今天会从北京飞到上海，晚上住在我家。她的飞机是晚上八点，我到了机场发现飞机会晚两个小时。我有点担心，因为晚上十点半可能就没有地铁了，我们只能坐出租车。机场到我家很远，坐车要两个小时呢，可能会很贵，到家也会很晚。明她还要早起去公司，祝她好运吧！"], "traditional_paragraphs": ["我的好朋友明天在上海有一個工作面試，所以她今天會從北京飛到上海，晚上住在我家。她的飛機是晚上八點，我到了機場發現飛機會晚兩個小時。我有點擔心，因為晚上十點半可能就沒有地鐵了，我們只能坐出租車。機場到我家很遠，坐車要兩個小時呢，可能會很貴，到家也會很晚。明她還要早起去公司，祝她好運吧！"], "pinyin_paragraphs": ["wǒ de hǎo péng you míng tiān zài Shàng hǎi yǒu yī gè gōng zuò miàn shì， suǒ yǐ tā jīn tiān huì cóng Běi jīng fēi dào Shàng hǎi， wǎn shang zhù zài wǒ jiā。 tā de fēi jī shì wǎn shang bā diǎn， wǒ dào le jī chǎng fā xiàn fēi jī huì wǎn liǎng gè xiǎo shí。 wǒ yǒu diǎn dān xīn， yīn wèi wǎn shang shí diǎn bàn kě néng jiù méi yǒu dì tiě le， wǒ men zhǐ néng zuò chū zū chē。 jī chǎng dào wǒ jiā hěn yuǎn， zuò chē yào liǎng gè xiǎo shí ne， kě néng huì hěn guì， dào jiā yě huì hěn wǎn。 míng tā hái yào zǎo qǐ qù gōng sī， zhù tā hǎo yùn ba！"], "english_paragraphs": ["My good friend has a job interview in Shanghai tomorrow, so she’s flying here from Beijing today and staying at my place tonight. Her flight was scheduled for 8 p.m., but when I got to the airport, I found out it would be two hours late. I’m a little worried because the subway might stop running by 10:30, and then we’ll have to take a taxi. The airport is far from my home—it takes two hours by car—so the ride could be expensive, and we’ll get home very late. She has to get up early tomorrow to go to the company, too. Wish her luck!"], "english_full": "My good friend has a job interview in Shanghai tomorrow, so she’s flying here from Beijing today and staying at my place tonight. Her flight was scheduled for 8 p.m., but when I got to the airport, I found out it would be two hours late. I’m a little worried because the subway might stop running by 10:30, and then we’ll have to take a taxi. The airport is far from my home—it takes two hours by car—so the ride could be expensive, and we’ll get home very late. She has to get up early tomorrow to go to the company, too. Wish her luck!", "ruby_paragraphs": ["<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"wǒ\" data-defn=\"I; me; my\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">我</span><span class=\"tr\">我</span><rt>wǒ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"de\" data-defn=\"possessive particle (of; &#x27;s) / modifying particle (used after an attribute to modify a noun or to form a nominal expression)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">的</span><span class=\"tr\">的</span><rt>de</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"hǎo\" data-defn=\"good / appropriate; proper\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">好</span><span class=\"tr\">好</span><rt>hǎo</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"péng you\" data-defn=\"friend\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">朋友</span><span class=\"tr\">朋友</span><rt>péng you</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"míng tiān\" data-defn=\"tomorrow\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">明天</span><span class=\"tr\">明天</span><rt>míng tiān</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zài\" data-defn=\"(of sb or sth) to be (located) at\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">在</span><span class=\"tr\">在</span><rt>zài</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Shàng hǎi\" data-defn=\"Shanghai municipality\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">上海</span><span class=\"tr\">上海</span><rt>Shàng hǎi</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yǒu\" data-defn=\"to have; there is\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">有</span><span class=\"tr\">有</span><rt>yǒu</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yī\" data-defn=\"one / single / a (article)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gè\" data-defn=\"classifier for people or objects in general\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\